# Redmineflux Inline Issue Editor Plugin

## Introduction

The Redmineflux Inline Issue Editor Plugin enables fast in-place editing in Redmine, so users can update issue and project data directly from list/detail views without full page navigation.

It adds inline editing assets to issue and project screens and exposes helper APIs used by the editor UI.

